    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "III",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_26",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_27",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_28",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_29"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS To THE STAMP ACT 1949 Commencement of amendments to the Stamp Act 1949"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Chapter commences on the coming into operation of this Act except section 28 which is deemed to have come into operation on 11 February 2010. Amendment of section 8"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Stamp Act 1949, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in subsection 8(1) by inserting after the words “postal franking machine” the words “or digital franking machine”. Amendment of First Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 6 under “GENERAL EXEMPTIoNS” in the First Schedule to the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “Labuan offshore Financial Services Authority” the words “Labuan Financial Services Authority”. Amendment of Fifth Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_29__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_29__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Fifth Schedule to the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_29__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_29",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the heading of that Schedule, by inserting after the words “postal franking machine” the words “or digital franking machine”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_29__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_III__cl_29",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after item 9 the following items: “10. Letter of indemnity. 11. Letter of guarantee. 12. Letter of allotment. 13. Education loan agreement. 14. Articles of Association of a company. 15. Memorandum of Association of a company. 16. Any other agreement approved by the Collector.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 46 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph (1)(c) the following paragraph: “ (c) an amount limited to a maximum of five thousand ringgit in respect of medical treatment, special needs or carer expenses expended in that basis year by that individual for his parents and the claim is evidenced by certification of a medical practitioner that the medical conditions of the parents require medical treatment or special needs or carer and— (i) in the case of medical treatment or special needs, a receipt on the amount expended; or (ii) in the case of carer, a written certification or receipt from, or work permit of, the carer: Provided that for the purpose of this paragraph, “carer” shall not include that individual, his wife or her husband or the child of that individual;”. Amendment of section 49"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 49 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (1)(a), by deleting the words “other than an insurance policy to which subsection (1C) applies”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (1)(c), by inserting after the word “widows” the word “, widowers”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting subsection (1C). Amendment of section 50"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 50(2) of the principal Act is amended by deleting the words “or for any insurance policy determined by the Employees Provident Fund Board referred to in subsection 49(1C),”. Amendment of section 60f"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 60f(2) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the definition of “business of holding of an investment” the following definition: ‘ “dividend” is deemed to include income distributed by a unit trust;’. Amendment of section 60h"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 60h(5) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the definition of “closed-end fund company” the following definition: ‘ “dividend” is deemed to include income distributed by a unit trust;’. Amendment of section 63b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 63b(2) of the principal Act is amended by inserting before the definition of “permitted expenses” the following definition: ‘ “dividend” is deemed to include income distributed by a unit trust;’. Amendment of section 65"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 65(11)(c) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “the widow” the words “or widower”. Amendment of section 74"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 74(3) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph (a) the following paragraph: “ (a) the Director General is informed of the death of the individual by the executor referred to under subsection (1) in the form prescribed under this Act;”. Amendment of section 104"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 104(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph (b) the following paragraph: “ (b) all sums payable by him under subsection 103(1a), (3), (4), (5), (6), (7) or (8) or subsection 107b(3) or (4) or subsection 107C(9) or (10);”. Amendment of section 107c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 107C of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (8) the following subsection: “(8) Notwithstanding subsections (1), (3), (4), (5), (6) and (7), the Director General may direct such company, trust body or co-operative society to make payment by instalments on account of tax which is or may be payable by that company, trust body or co-operative society for a year of assessment at such times and of such amounts as the Director General may direct and such account of tax shall be deemed for the purpose of subsection (10) to be the revised estimate of tax payable by that company, trust body or co-operative society for that year of assessment: Provided that, where the direction is made before the ninth month of the basis period for that year of assessment, that company, trust body or co-operative society may furnish a revised estimate of its tax payable for that year of assessment in accordance with subsection (7).”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting subsections (8a) and (8b); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (10), by substituting for the words “revised estimate of tax payable for that year of assessment or if no revised estimate is furnished” the words “revised estimate under subsection (7) or deemed revised estimate under subsection (8), whichever is later, or if no such revised estimate is furnished or there is no such deemed revised estimate”. Amendment of section 111"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_20__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_20__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 111 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_20__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1a), by substituting for the words “subsection 77(1) section 77a” the words “subsection 77(1) or section 77a”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_20__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection: “(4a) Any amount of excess in respect of tax payable for a year of assessment which is to be refunded to a person under subsection (1) may be utilized by the Director General for the payment of any other amount of tax which is due and payable (including any amount of instalments which are due and payable) by that person under this Act, or under the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 or the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976. (4b) Where amount of excess in respect of a person is ascertained in accordance with subsection 50(4) of the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 or subsection 24(7a) of the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 such excess shall be applied for the payment of tax which is due and payable (including any amount of instalments which are due and payable) by that person under this Act.”. Amendment of section 132"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_21__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_21__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 132 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_21__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by inserting after the words “tax under this Act” the words “or other taxes of every kind under any written law”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_21__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (4)(d), by inserting after the words “tax under this Act” the words “or other taxes of every kind under any written law”. New section 132a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 132 the following section: “ Tax information exchange arrangements 132a. (1) If the Minister by statutory order declares that— (a) arrangements specified in the order have been made by the Government with the government of any territory outside Malaysia with a view to the exchange of information forseeably relevant to the administration or assessment or collection or enforcement of the taxes under this Act or other taxes of every kind under any written law and any foreign tax of that territory; and (b) it is expedient that those arrangements should have effect, then, so long as the order remains in force, notwithstanding anything in any written law, those arrangements shall have effect in relation to tax under this Act or other taxes of every kind under any written law. (2) No arrangement under this section can be made if the order in respect of an arrangement under section 132 is in force. (3) Where any arrangements have effect by virtue of this section, section 138 shall not prevent the disclosure to a duly authorized servant or agent of the government with which the arrangements have been made of such information as is required to be disclosed under the arrangements. (4) Any order made under this section shall be laid before the Dewan Rakyat.”. Amendment of section 154"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 154 of the principal Act is amended in paragraph"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "(1)(c) by inserting after the words “section 132” the words “or 132a”. Amendment of Schedule 6"
      }
    },
    {
