      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “foreign tax” by inserting after the word “Malaysia” the words “and in relation to paragraph 132(4)(d) or section 132a includes other taxes of every kind imposed by or under the laws of that territory”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “Inland Revenue Board of Malaysia” the following definitions: ‘ “Labuan business activity” has the meaning assigned to it in the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990 [Act 445]; “Labuan company” means a Labuan company incorporated under the Labuan Companies Act 1990 [Act 441] and includes a foreign Labuan company registered under that Act, Labuan limited partnership established and registered under the Labuan Limited Partnerships and Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2010 [Act 707], Labuan trust as defined in the Labuan Trusts Act 1996 [Act 554] and a Malaysian bank as defined in the Labuan Financial Services and Securities Act 2010 [Act 704];’;"
      }
    },
