      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (f), by substituting for the proviso the following proviso: “Provided that— (i) this paragraph shall not apply if the payer has paid the amount referred to in subsection (2) of that section; and (ii) where such tax is deducted or such amount is paid after the due date for the furnishing of a return for a year of assessment that relates to such payment, the tax or amount so paid shall not prejudice the imposition of penalty under subsection 113(2) if a deduction on such payment is made in such return or is claimed in the information given to the Director General in arriving at the adjusted income of the payer;”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (i), by substituting for the proviso the following proviso: “Provided that— (i) this paragraph shall not apply if the payer has paid the amount referred to in subsection (2) of that section; and (ii) where such tax is deducted or such amount is paid after the due date for the furnishing of a return for a year of assessment that relates to such payment, the tax or amount so paid shall not prejudice the imposition of penalty under subsection 113(2) if a deduction on such payment is made in such return or is claimed in the information given to the Director General in arriving at the adjusted income of the payer;”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (j), by substituting for the proviso the following proviso: “Provided that— (i) this paragraph shall not apply if the payer has paid the amount referred to in subsection (2) of that section; and (ii) where such tax is deducted or such amount is paid after the due date for the furnishing of a return for a year of assessment that relates to such payment, the tax or amount so paid shall not prejudice the imposition of penalty under subsection 113(2) if a deduction on such payment is made in such return or is claimed in the information given to the Director General in arriving at the adjusted income of the payer;”. Amendment of section 46"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "IV",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_30",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_31",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_32"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS To THE PETRoLEUM (INCoME TAX) ACT 1967 Commencement of amendments to the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_30__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_30__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_30__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 31 is deemed to have come into operation on 9 April 2009."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_30__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 32 commences on the coming into operation of this Act. Amendment of section 16"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in subsection 16(7e) by substituting for the words “Ministry of Tourism” the words “Ministry of Information, Communication and Culture”. Amendment of section 50"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 50 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsections: “(4) Any amount of excess in respect of tax payable for a year of assessment which is to be refunded to a person under subsection (1) may be utilized by the Director General for the payment of any other amount of tax which is due and payable (including any amount of instalments which are due and payable) by that person under this Act, or under the Income Tax Act 1967 or the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976. (5) Where amount of excess in respect of a person is ascertained in accordance with subsection 111(4a) of the Income Tax Act 1967 or subsection 24(7a) of the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 such excess shall be applied for the payment of tax which is due and payable (including any amount of instalments which are due and payable) by that person under this Act.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_I__cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Finance (No. 2) Act 2010. Amendment of Acts"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_I__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53], the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378], the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 [Act 543], the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 [Act 169], the Finance Act 2007 [Act 683] and the Finance Act 2009 [Act 693] are amended in the manner specified in Chapters II, III, IV, V, VI and VII respectively."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "V",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_33",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_34",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_35",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_36"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS To THE REAL PRoPERTY GAINS TAX ACT 1976 Commencement of amendments to the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "VI",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_37",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_38",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_39"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS To THE FINANCE ACT 2007 Commencement of amendments to the Finance Act 2007"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VII",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "VII",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_40",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_41",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_42"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS To THE FINANCE ACT 2009 Commencement of amendments to the Finance Act 2009"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_40",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "40",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Chapter is deemed to have come into operation on 9 January 2009. Amendment of section 48"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_41",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "41",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Finance Act 2009, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in section 48 by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection: “(5) Any debt due under this section shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under the principal Act.”. Amendment of section 49"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_42",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "42",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 49 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection: “(5) Any debt due under this section shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under the principal Act.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_37",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "37",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Chapter is deemed to have effect from the year of assessment 2008 and have effect for subsequent years of assessment. Amendment of section 48"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_38",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "38",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Finance Act 2007, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in section 48 by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(4) Any debt due under this section shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under the principal Act.”. Amendment of section 49"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_39",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "39",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 49 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(4) Any debt due under this section shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under the principal Act.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_33",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "33",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_33__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_33__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_33__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 34 and 35 commence on the coming into operation of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_33__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 36 has effect for the year of assessment 2011 and subsequent years of assessment. Amendment of section 14"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_34",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "34",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in subsection 14(4) by substituting for the proviso the following proviso: “Provided that no such assessment shall be made more than three years after the end of the year of assessment in which the Director General is informed in writing by the executor of the death of that chargeable person in a form prescribed under this Act.”. Amendment of section 24"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_35",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "35",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 24 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (7) the following subsections: “(7a) Any amount of excess in respect of tax payable for a year of assessment which is to be refunded to a person under subsection (1) may be utilized by the Director General for the payment of any other amount of tax which is due and payable (including any amount of instalments which are due and payable) by that person under this Act, or under the Income Tax Act 1967 or the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967. (7b) Where amount of excess in respect of a person is ascertained in accordance with subsection 111(4a) of the Income Tax Act 1967 or subsection 50(4) of the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 such excess shall be applied for the payment of tax which is due and payable (including any amount of instalments which are due and payable) by that person under this Act.”. Amendment of Schedule 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V__cl_36",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "36",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/37/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule 2 to the principal Act is amended in subparagraph 16(a) by inserting after the word “Government” wherever appearing the words “or a State Government”."
      }
    }
  ]
}
